    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$bar_intro",
        "key": "$bar_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true,
        "focus": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Did you all have to start hanging out here this early?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What? There's just an hour and a half left until Maria's match! It's her first bout since her intensive training! There's no way I'd miss it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha, well said. Everything is on the house today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*... What a ruffian...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, your 'Thorn Tear.' It's not often you order something this strong. Are you worried about her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If I count from the day Zofia had me train her in swordsmanship, it took her four whole years to get to the preliminaries... But Maria only had four weeks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "We should keep an eye on them. When it's time to call it quits, that's when they need to stop. We mustn't let them go overboard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha... They're just a bunch of young, passionate knights. It brings me back to the time when Margaret decided to throw her name in the hat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But they are nothing like her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, trust in her a little.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as she's creative with how she accumulates her points, getting qualified for the Major isn't really anything so difficult.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That might work for your everyday contestants, but.. I'm not sure if that'll work for Maria...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a feeling... there's going to be trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter now, V? Why are you always pouring cold water on everything? What, are you jealous? Have you no shame?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to say that again?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
