        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "Laaaaadies and gentlemen! Welcommmmme to the Roar Arena!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're in for a treat today at this arena, fully sponsored by the Roar Guards Company! 'Roar Guards, even the winds will bow to you!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't have an independent knight to put your money on yet, then let me introduce to you once again\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been a long month since she became the talk of the town with her debut match, and who knows what kind of training she's gone through in preparation for this day!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please join me and welcome the cutest contestant to ever grace the Roar Arena, sister to the legend, the Nearl family's youngest ever competition knight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maaaaarrriiiiiia Nearllll!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I bet my entire fortune on you! Nearl!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tourist"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Whistle* Radiant Knight! Lil' Radiant Knight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "This atmosphere really is over-the-top... Hey, you! You're blocking my view! Sit down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I wonder how long it's been since the last time I was in the audience.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Okay, Maria... Don't get nervous.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_arena_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Take a deep breath... Deep breath.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Mmn... There's so many people looking at me...!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "(No, I shouldn't worry about my surroundings so much... Deep breath... Deep breath...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone! Please calm down! I know how excited you all are right now, but please try to calm down a little!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Try to give the young lady a little space. If she gets stage fright and calls it quits, the Roar Guards won't be issuing any refunds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right! Support her with the cash in your wallets, not your voices! There's nothing more exciting than seeing your favorite knightess reign victorious thanks to your support, especially the monetary kind!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_sportsbar",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like Greatmouth Mob got paid off by the Roar Guards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What a lowlife. *Spit*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, look at the Roar Guards trying to take on Raythean at their own game. They don't know their place, do they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even the putty I played with back when I was a kid lasts longer than the armors they churn out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why don't I see you working at some big-name company, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Over my dead body! I've sworn off building equipment for knights!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why you still haven't paid off your tab for a whole year already! Because you don't take work that pays.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I haven't picked up my tab because I've got bills to pay! Why else would I be fixing pipes? I'm not even a plumber!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha... Speaking of which, Old Lady Layla left you a message. She wants you to fix some lights for her son...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I... err... Who's Maria up against?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_arena_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright\u2014! With a crowd this enthusiastic, how could the Roar Arena and its sponsor, the Roar Guards, let anyone down?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one who will go face to face with the Radiant Knight's sister is none other than the vanguard who led Roar K.C., the knightclub proudly sponsored by the Roar Guards, to the top 100 in the last Major.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I can hear you complaining! I've got to get a word in for our sponsors. That's no less important than the events themselves! And so\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now hold your horses, we're getting there. Our heroine will soon be facing the judgement of the fiercest storm of her life!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "His might and economical title are unmatched on today's roster! Please join me and welcome the 'Plastic', Szewczyk!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Szewczyk! Szewczyk!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take her down, Szewczyk! All my money's on the line here! Don't disappoint us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "The 'Plastic' Szewczyk, everyone, and check out his armor from the Roar Guards Company, made with the newest materials! Will the latest in Columbian armor technology prove to be the decisive element in this match?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. The Roar Guards provide all enterprising knights with the most bespoke, personalized equipment services! Maintenance, upgrades, retrofits, you name it! We'll craft up a storm in our workshops!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't forget, 'Roar Guards, even the winds will bow to you!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I didn't expect to see you here... and I definitely didn't expect to find you in the audience while I'm in the ring.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Szewczyk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Whislash' Zofia. I thought you'd never set foot in this place again after your injury, lest you humiliate yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, you only know to kick a lady when she's down. You're still all talk and no show.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember how many points I snatched from you when we faced each other in the prelims, Plastic Toy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you were just a bit smarter... Whatever, why am I even talking to you about this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it you who trained that kid? In just one month?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, you better stop talking to me and keep your eye on the arena if you don't want her to break you like a toy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. Well, looks like I can look forward to a decent fight...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd better watch out, Plastic Toy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh... We'll see how that turns out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.3,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Ohh? It looked like Szewczyk talked to someone in the audience briefly before he stepped into the ring. And who would've thought? It's 'Whislash', Zofia! What a surprise we have in our audience today!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Spit*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, the two knights have entered the arena. Keep your eyes on them! You don't want to miss any action!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone! Everyone! Do you see Szewczyk's armor shining under the lights? Do you see Maria's beautiful blond hair fluttering in the wind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anything you see will soon be consumed by the most intense bloodbath of the day! They'll be going all out to bring each other down! Rules\u2014Who cares? This is the Kazimierz Major!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "ac13_6",
        "xScale": 1,
        "yScale": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Before our dimwitted judges make their decision, you can and should support your favorite! Of course! Your support will directly influence the outcome!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "If your purse is feeling a little light, you can scream all you want. Not that it'll do anything but give yourself some unearned pride and the rest of us an earache. If you dig deep, you can buy some chips to support your contestant!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, here comes the booing again, but guess what? To celebrate the Major reaching its highest number of contestants ever, the Roar Arena's cut's been lowered to an unheard of 50%!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "For every ten gold coins you spend, five of them will help your favorite contestants! This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course! The Roar Arena isn't just raking in all those commissions for nothing. If you've got your money on one of our contestants, as long as they win in some way, you'll have the chance to make some big bucks!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "The odds? Forget it! The odds are in your own hands! The bankroll? It's what you're throwing down for your knights! Don't hesitate! It's time to fork out anything you've got for your warriors!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
